                Report Designs
              </h1>
              <p className="text-muted-foreground mt-2 max-w-xl">
                Design document reports for each entity. Once designed, users see a Print button when viewing records.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </header>

        <div className="flex-1 overflow-auto px-8 py-8">
          {tables.length === 0 ? (
